Package: picard
Title: PICARD is an internal R package designed to manage and coordinate the execution of modular R scripts across the UMC Utrecht data transformation pipeline
Version: 1.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("Mattia", "Cinelli", , "m.cinelli@umcutrecht.nl", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-9306-8079"))
Description: It provides a unified interface to configure, trigger, and log multi-step ETL pipelines (T2–T5) used for clinical data harmonisation and analysis within the VAC4EU network and UMCU’s Digital Research Environment (DRE).
    The package enables:- Dynamic orchestration of project-specific transformation scripts, Configuration-driven control of pipeline substeps (T2–T5), Logging, auditing, plottinh and reproducibility tracking.
    PICARD is designed to “make it run”: ensuring consistent, transparent, and reproducible execution of UMCU’s data processing pipelines.
